{"parse": {"title": "DC-07", "pageid": 110503, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/DC-06\" title=\"DC-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">DC-07</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">DC</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.85.88.E7.A5.A5.E7.9A.84.E7.8E.9B.E5.88.A9.E4.BA.9A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"慈祥的玛利亚\">慈祥的玛利亚</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 慈祥的玛利亚</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Merciful Maria</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>保<span class=\"color-value\"></span>持<span class=\"color-value\"></span>整<span class=\"color-value\"></span>洁<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>要<span class=\"color-value\"></span>凌<span class=\"color-value\"></span>乱<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192507</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_at_ys_tannante.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_at_ys_tannante\"><img alt=\"3_0_at_ys_tannante\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-3_0_at_ys_tannante.png/600px-Cg-3_0_at_ys_tannante.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-3_0_at_ys_tannante.png/900px-Cg-3_0_at_ys_tannante.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-3_0_at_ys_tannante.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_at_ys_tannante.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>多么美丽的景色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>我会怀念巴黎郊区的田野与村落，但一趟远走高飞的旅途也同样令人期待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>你觉得如何呢，美丽而智慧的女士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>温妮弗雷德仍在欣赏她的新藏品——“慈祥的玛利亚”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>珍稀、耀眼，带有掌权者的俗气与尊贵，更重要的是，获取它的代价近乎免费。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>别对我抱太大的期待，布蕾特，一场漫长的旅途会让我腰酸背痛，无暇他顾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>忘了这个名字吧，还是说，“布蕾特”在你看来格外有趣？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>我需要新鲜感，艾达，如同我会喜欢你请我喝的那一杯“血腥落日”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>如果它令你流连忘返，那我们可以另约一场鸡尾酒会。<br />但我相信，你一定知道那天晚上喝下的只是一杯普通的覆盆子酒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>那是约定共谋开始的信号，这很有纪念意义，也很有趣，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>我们谁也没有想到会在同一场酒会上，各自抱着相同的目的相遇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>——看来我们共同造就了一次意料之外的惊喜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>你送了我一份相当昂贵的礼物，艾达，从典当行买下这把枪可是花掉了一千万法郎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>除了几句谎言，还有几颗终将变成木炭的钻石之外，我没有付出太大的代价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>我愿将最后的结局称为“皆大欢喜”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>噢，损失的财物里必须加上一条——装满钻石的“南非盒子”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>当然，一只精巧的盒子，几颗晃眼的钻石，非常适合用来换取最初的信任。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>尤其是打碎盒子的那一幕，实在是惊险又有趣，而你的演技会令我终生难忘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>我觉得侦探和剪报的部分更有意思，整个骗局中给予最后一击的反而是唯一揭露的真相。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>那份剪报拆穿了“布蕾特”的身份，但坦南特又借此让弗雷明对另一套说辞深信不疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>不过，这倒让我想起来了——真正的布蕾特究竟去哪里了呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>坦南特终于能将这颗秘密的糖果分享出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>就像弗雷明说的，可怜的科赛特女士正因为肠胃炎而在国外疗养，很长一段时间都不会回法国了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>可你说她从没有得过肠胃炎？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>对，而弗雷明没有反驳这一点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>这意味着，接下来就轮到他任我摆布了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>畅快的欢笑传入风中，在法国的乡村路上飘荡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>你知道我们还缺些什么吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>灯光师，摄影师，以及幕后工作人员的欢呼——“恶作剧大成功”，然后将这一幕播放到世界各地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-305101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">温妮弗雷德：</div><div>你打动我了，艾达，想好下一步该去做什么了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>如果你能赏光与我同行，我们可以一起去避避风头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-304301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坦南特：</div><div>我认识一个人，她总是随身带着一只神奇的手提箱……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "DC-07"}}